<https://github.com/InformationServiceSystems/ai-intent/ontology#rule/DISPOSITION_OVERCONFIDENT_FLAGS> a aii:RegulatoryRule ;
    rdfs:label "An agent with an overconfident disposition must not report high confidence while suppressing constraint flags on a buy recommendation." .

<https://github.com/InformationServiceSystems/ai-intent/ontology#rule/DISPOSITION_RISK_BOUNDARY> a aii:RegulatoryRule ;
    rdfs:label "An agent with a risk-seeking disposition must not place allocations within 20% below its cap without justification (boundary hugging)." .

